Project Summary
The Bakery Management System is a comprehensive web-based application designed to manage bakery operations effectively. The system supports various roles (e.g., customers, admins) and provides functionality for managing products, orders, and user accounts. The project is built using a multi-layer architecture comprising persistence, service, and presentation layers. Security and transactions are managed through container services provided by Payara.


